note seed/node/tests/view-accept.om: DRA-291 acceptance, the operator view and commands of omnode-code
note driven only through omnode-op (seed/node/op.om) against the real workflow; the Omega port of
note view-accept.py. Usage: view-accept BUILD OMC ROUND40 OUTDIR [SCENARIO...]. BUILD holds
note code-main, code-test, infer, tool, op and fake-serve (all built from .om). OMC is the compiler
note round40 used (its error text is part of the prompts). ROUND40 holds final-selected.json. The
note model is replaced by fake-serve, which answers the real omnode-infer with the recorded round40
note turns (nd_prep writes its map), so every run is deterministic and takes seconds. SCENARIO names
note select among full resync commands cancel redirect budget overload uncertain crash (all when
note none is given). Prints one PASS/FAIL line per check (cut at 400 characters) and
note "VIEWSUM pass=P fail=F"; exit 0 when nothing failed, 1 otherwise, 2 for usage. Answers in the
note details are the compact JSON op printed (view-accept.py printed Python reprs).
note Composition: om2, seed/json/json.om, seed/node/tests/drv.om, seed/node/tests/nodedrv.om, this.
note Names: va_* functions, va*/vk*/vd*/vl*/vn*/vi*/vp*/vt* globals and texts.

note vas: [0] the node's process slot, [1] fake-serve's. vav: scenario numbers (full: [0] gone, [1]
note gaps, [2] answer kinds seen (1 delta, 2 snapshot, 4 other), [3] CWE lines; commands, crash:
note [4] an answer's version; overload: [5] refusals seen, [6] limit, [7] the command kept (0 none, 1
note committed, 2 other); uncertain: [8] 1 when a view listed uncertain jobs, [9] that view's
note incarnation, [10] its list's length, [11] its first job, [12] kind 7 events, [13] [14] the
note first one's words 4 and 2, [15] the objective index; crash: [9] [10] the old incarnation and
note version). vat, vatl: four kept texts of up to 1024 bytes (va_keep, va_put). vapos[0]: the
note number parser's position (va_num).
global vas ulong 4
global vav long 16
global vat uchar 4096
global vatl ulong 4
global vapos ulong 1

text vausage "usage: view-accept BUILD OMC ROUND40 OUTDIR [SCENARIO...]\n"
text vasum "VIEWSUM pass="
text vafail " fail="
text vaprep "prep"
text vatp "t_"

text vn0 "full"
text vn1 "resync"
text vn2 "commands"
text vn3 "cancel"
text vn4 "redirect"
text vn5 "budget"
text vn6 "overload"
text vn7 "uncertain"
text vn8 "crash"
text vncmds "cmds"
text vi0 "76666,83423,82342,85188"
text vi1 "76666"
text vi3 "76666,83423"
text vi6 "76666,83423,82342"
text vi7 "76666,82342,85188"
text vpmain "code-main"
text vpovl "code-test overload 1"
text vpunc "code-test uncertain"
text vtrun "run"
text vtrun2 "run2"

text vk01 "full-view-up"
text vk02 "full-snapshot"
text vk03 "full-run"
text vk04 "full-delta-stream"
text vk05 "full-view-stopped"
text vk06 "resync-delta-from-0"
text vk07 "resync-other-incarnation"
text vk08 "resync-future-since"
text vk09 "op-usage-control"
text vk10 "cmd-stale-409"
text vk11 "cmd-invalid-budget"
text vk12 "cmd-other-incarnation"
text vk13 "cmd-budget-committed"
text vk14 "cmd-budget-visible"
text vk15 "cmd-duplicate-ack"
text vk16 "cmd-pause"
text vk17 "cmd-pause-duplicate-version"
text vk18 "cmd-pause-again-invalid"
text vk19 "cmd-paused-holds"
text vk20 "cmd-resume"
text vk21 "cmd-run-completes"
text vk22 "cancel-committed"
