note va_fl o p b: lines 1 and 2 of b split at newlines, as Python prints that list.
fn va_fl o edit uchar 1024 p ulong b view uchar * to ulong
q = dv_byte o p 91
k = ulong 0
s = ulong 0
c = ulong 0
