note va_urs cx js tp: the next incarnation (a new fake-serve, the node of code-main as run2) lists
note the uncertain job again exactly when the journal holds its START without a settled DONE.
fn va_urs cx edit uchar 65536 js edit uchar ndjsz tp edit uint dvtcap to void
